45007::$$$message_0400_0000_0000$$$::"Damn it. Still, the Einzberns' bodyguard wears that coat really well..."::
45008::$$$message_0400_0000_0001$$$::"One day, I'll be a man who looks good in a dark coat, too! Just imagine, the coattails billowing in the wind...in slow motion!"::

